2
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:37,400
ゆらゆらり はらはらり
Swaying gently, softly wavering...

3
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:40,700
色とりどり 乱れ咲き
...vibrant colors blooming wildly.

4
00:03:40,700 --> 00:03:43,700
花の街 思い出す
Reminding me of the flower town...

5
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:46,800
この空から
...from beneath this sky.

6
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:52,500
百花繚乱
Hyakka Ryoulan

7
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:56,200
ひょんな出来事から
From an unexpected turn of events,

8
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:59,800
やってきたこの場所は
the place where I have arrived...

9
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,600
遥か遠くにあった
...was once so far away...

10
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:05,800
煌びやかな舞台
...now a dazzling stage.

11
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:10,800
ハッとするほど鮮やかな世界が
I realized that a world so breathtakingly vibrant...

12
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:13,100
あるんだと知った
...truly does exist.

13
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:16,800
あなたの無理難題に答えていく
Answering every unreasonable challenge you throw,

14
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,400
その度に
each and every time...

15
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:23,200
あっと言わせるような奇想天外な
...with mind-boggling, jaw-dropping answers...

16
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:25,700
答え合わせで
...to see if we match,

17
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:28,100
辿り着いたその先に
and beyond where I have arrived,

18
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:32,400
新しい景色が待っているんだ
a brand new scenery is waiting.

19
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:41,200
摩訶不思議なミステリー
A wondrous mystery,

20
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:44,800
次から次に起こるたび
